      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00899",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "嗨，注意脚底下！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Hey, watch your step!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00899",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "……大概摔一跤也不疼的关系，他并没当成一回事，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "...Probably because falling did not hurt much, he did not take it seriously,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00899",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "只要有稍稍隆起的沙包，或者沙坑，",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "whenever there was even a slightly raised mound of sand, or a hollow in it,",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00899",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "他都会被绊倒，膝盖着地……",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "he would trip and come down on his knees...",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "woman-in-the-dunes-p00899",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "虽说膝盖着地倒也没什么，可万一碰上个深深的沙崖该怎么办！",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Landing on his knees was not so bad, but what if he ran into a deep sand cliff!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
